graph LR
  subgraph Client[客户端]
    UI[页面UI] --> Router[Router中间件]
    Router --> PrefPlan[预取计划 等级 时序 TTL]
    PrefPlan --> SW[Service Worker 执行器]
    SW --> Cache[缓存存储]
    Telemetry[埋点与画像采集] --> LogBuf[本地日志缓冲]
    OnDev[端侧轻量模型] --> Router
  end

  subgraph Edge[边缘网关]
    EdgeCtrl[策略下发 灰度 回滚]
  end

  subgraph Cloud[云侧]
    LLM[大模型策略服务]
    Solver[预算约束求解 阈值生成]
    PolicyRepo[策略 版本 白名单]
    Offline[反事实评估 训练 蒸馏]
  end

  Router --> LLM
  LLM --> Solver
  Solver --> EdgeCtrl
  EdgeCtrl --> OnDev
  EdgeCtrl --> Router
  Router --> SW
  SW --> Network[网络]
  SW --> UI
  LogBuf --> Offline
  Offline --> OnDev
  Offline --> PolicyRepo
  PolicyRepo --> EdgeCtrl

